# 00-project-control/logs/

Append-only progress logs.

| File             | Purpose                                              |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `progress-log.md`| Daily / per-session progress entries                 |
| `progress/`      | Per-sprint archives once `progress-log.md` rotates   |

Rotation policy: `.harness/quality.yml.memory_management.rotate_progress_log_by`.
